    <div class="sub">One key: <code>/scrape</code> a page to Markdown, <code>/extract</code> it to JSON, <code>/search</code> the web, <code>/serp</code> for Google's results page as data, <code>/answer</code> a question with sources. Free: <span data-credit="limits.community.requests_per_minute">10</span> a minute, <span data-credit="limits.community.concurrent">2</span> at a time, <span data-credit="monthly">1,000</span> credits every month. Plans: <span data-credit="plans.starter.per_minute">120</span> a minute, <span data-credit="plans.starter.at_once">10</span> at a time, from $<span data-credit="plans.starter.usd">10</span> a month.</div>
