    <div class="fence" id="playground">
      <div class="fbar"><div class="ftabs" role="tablist" aria-label="playground service">
        <button class="ft" aria-selected="true" data-tab="scrape">scrape</button>
        <button class="ft" aria-selected="false" data-tab="extract">extract</button>
        <button class="ft" aria-selected="false" data-tab="search">search</button>
        <button class="ft" aria-selected="false" data-tab="answer">answer <span class="xtag">exp</span></button>
        <button class="ft" aria-selected="false" data-tab="serp">serp <span class="xtag">beta</span></button>
      </div><span class="ep"><span class="m" data-method>POST</span> api.crawl4ai.com<span data-path>/scrape</span></span></div>
      <div class="fbody">
        <div class="targetrow">
          <span class="verb">$ crawl <span data-verb>scrape</span></span>
          <label class="tfield" title="Click to edit, then Run">
            <input class="target" data-target spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" aria-label="URL or query to run">
            <span class="pen"><span class="peni">✎</span></span>
          </label>
          <button class="run" data-run>▶ Run</button><button class="run est" data-estimate title="what this call would cost, before it runs">≈ Estimate</button>
        </div>
        <div class="instr-row" data-instrrow><span class="verb2">&nbsp;&nbsp;--instruction</span>
          <label class="tfield"><input class="target" data-instr spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" aria-label="what to extract" placeholder="what to extract - e.g. titles, points, prices"></label>
          <span class="run runghost" aria-hidden="true">▶ Run</span>
        </div>
        <div class="deep-row" data-deeprow><label><input type="checkbox" data-deep checked> <span>▸ deep</span> <span class="dhint">ground the answer in the top results</span></label></div>
        <div class="egs" data-egs></div>
        <pre class="cmd" data-cmd></pre>
        <div class="estline" data-est hidden></div>
        <div class="rr"><button class="cpy" data-copycmd>Copy full command</button><span class="live">Live · play limits</span><span class="ok" data-ok>✓ 200 OK</span></div>
        <div class="out" data-out aria-live="polite"><span class="ph"># Type a URL above and hit Run - real output renders here</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2 id="features"><span class="h">##</span> What you get <a class="anch" href="#features">#</a></h2>
    <ul class="md">
      <li><b>/scrape</b> URL → clean Markdown, boilerplate stripped, ready for a prompt.</li>
      <li><b>/extract</b> URL + a plain-English ask → typed JSON records. No selectors.</li>
      <li><b>/search</b> query → ranked results as JSON - add <code>rich=1</code> for follow-ups, related &amp; more.</li>
      <li><b>/answer</b> a question → a direct answer with its sources. Experimental.</li>
      <li><b>/serp</b> query → Google's results page as data: true ranks, every block, localised to a place. For rank tracking. Beta since 8 Oct 2026.</li>
      <li><b>at scale</b> queues, jobs, retries, and solid proxies - handled for you.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="agents"><span class="h">##</span> Use it in Claude Code, Cursor &amp; agents <span class="tag">- paste one line</span> <a class="anch" href="#agents">#</a></h2>
    <p class="lead">Same key everywhere. Mint one above and it drops into each line below.</p>
    <div class="recs">
      <div class="rec" data-setup><div class="meta"><b>Ask your agent</b><span>one line in its chat: it reads llms.txt and sets itself up</span></div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="line"><code><span class="p">set up crawl4ai</span> - https://crawl4ai.com/llms.txt with key: <span class="tok" data-kt>sk_live_…</span></code><button class="cp" data-tmpl='set up crawl4ai - https://crawl4ai.com/llms.txt with key: TOKEN'>Copy</button></div>
          <div class="where">Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, OpenCode, OpenClaw, or any agent that reads a URL · <a href="/llms.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener">open llms.txt</a></div>
        </div></div>
      <div class="rec"><div class="meta"><b>MCP</b><span>your agent's tools, one line per tool</span></div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="agtabs" role="tablist" aria-label="your client">
            <button class="at" aria-selected="true" data-agent="claude">Claude Code</button>
            <button class="at" aria-selected="false" data-agent="codex">Codex</button>
            <button class="at" aria-selected="false" data-agent="opencode">OpenCode</button>
            <button class="at" aria-selected="false" data-agent="cursor">Cursor · Windsurf</button>
            <button class="at" aria-selected="false" data-agent="openclaw">OpenClaw</button>
            <button class="at" aria-selected="false" data-agent="any">any client</button>
          </div>
          <div data-agent-block="claude">
            <div class="line"><code><span class="p">claude</span> mcp add --transport http crawl4ai https://api.crawl4ai.com/mcp --header <span class="a">"Authorization: Bearer <span class="tok" data-kt>sk_live_…</span>"</span></code><button class="cp" data-tmpl='claude mcp add --transport http crawl4ai https://api.crawl4ai.com/mcp --header "Authorization: Bearer TOKEN"'>Copy</button></div></div>
          <div data-agent-block="codex" hidden><div class="where">~/.codex/config.toml</div>
            <div class="line"><code>[mcp_servers.crawl4ai] url = <span class="a">"https://api.crawl4ai.com/mcp"</span> http_headers = { Authorization = <span class="a">"Bearer <span class="tok" data-kt>sk_live_…</span>"</span> }</code><button class="cp" data-tmpl='[mcp_servers.crawl4ai]
url = "https://api.crawl4ai.com/mcp"
http_headers = { Authorization = "Bearer TOKEN" }'>Copy</button></div></div>
          <div data-agent-block="opencode" hidden><div class="where">opencode.json</div>
            <div class="line"><code><span class="a">"mcp"</span>: { <span class="a">"crawl4ai"</span>: { "type": "remote", "url": "https://api.crawl4ai.com/mcp", "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer <span class="tok" data-kt>sk_live_…</span>" } } }</code><button class="cp" data-tmpl='"mcp": { "crawl4ai": { "type": "remote", "url": "https://api.crawl4ai.com/mcp", "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer TOKEN" } } }'>Copy</button></div></div>
          <div data-agent-block="cursor" hidden><div class="where">~/.cursor/mcp.json · Windsurf: ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json</div>
            <div class="line"><code><span class="a">"crawl4ai"</span>: { "url": "https://api.crawl4ai.com/mcp", "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer <span class="tok" data-kt>sk_live_…</span>" } }</code><button class="cp" data-tmpl='"crawl4ai": { "url": "https://api.crawl4ai.com/mcp", "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer TOKEN" } }'>Copy</button></div></div>
          <div data-agent-block="openclaw" hidden><div class="where">~/.openclaw/openclaw.json, the mcp.servers block</div>
            <div class="line"><code>mcp: { servers: { <span class="a">crawl4ai</span>: { url: "https://api.crawl4ai.com/mcp", transport: "streamable-http", headers: { Authorization: "Bearer <span class="tok" data-kt>sk_live_…</span>" } } } }</code><button class="cp" data-tmpl='mcp: { servers: { crawl4ai: { url: "https://api.crawl4ai.com/mcp", transport: "streamable-http", headers: { Authorization: "Bearer TOKEN" } } } }'>Copy</button></div></div>
          <div data-agent-block="any" hidden><div class="where">Claude Desktop, ChatGPT, Gemini CLI, VS Code, n8n, or your own client · streamable HTTP</div>
            <div class="line"><code><span class="p">url</span> https://api.crawl4ai.com/mcp <span style="color:var(--dim)">·</span> <span class="p">header</span> <span class="a">Authorization: Bearer <span class="tok" data-kt>sk_live_…</span></span></code><button class="cp" data-tmpl='https://api.crawl4ai.com/mcp
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN'>Copy</button></div></div>
        </div></div>
      <div class="rec"><div class="meta"><b>HTTP</b><span>code or curl, any language: base url + key</span></div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="line"><code><span class="p">export</span> CRAWL4AI_URL=https://api.crawl4ai.com CRAWL4AI_KEY=<span class="tok" data-kt>sk_live_…</span></code><button class="cp" data-tmpl='export CRAWL4AI_URL=https://api.crawl4ai.com CRAWL4AI_KEY=TOKEN'>Copy</button></div>
          <div class="line"><code><span class="p">curl</span> -s "https://api.crawl4ai.com/search?q=web+scraping" -H <span class="a">"Authorization: Bearer <span class="tok" data-kt>sk_live_…</span>"</span></code><button class="cp" data-tmpl='curl -s "https://api.crawl4ai.com/search?q=web+scraping" -H "Authorization: Bearer TOKEN"'>Copy</button></div>
        </div></div>
    </div>

    <h2 id="self-host"><span class="h">##</span> Self-host, or skip the setup <a class="anch" href="#self-host">#</a></h2>
    <div class="paths">
      <div class="path"><div class="pt">// run it yourself</div><h3>Self-host</h3>
        <p>It's Apache-2.0. <code style="color:var(--teal);font-family:var(--mono)">pip install crawl4ai</code>, point it at your own boxes and proxies. No gate, no token. It's yours.</p>
        <div class="pact"><a class="ghost" href="https://github.com/unclecode/crawl4ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="color:var(--star)">★</span> Clone the repo</a></div></div>
      <div class="path hosted"><div class="pt">// let us run it</div><h3>Hosted</h3>
        <p>Or forget the infra. We've operated this crawler at scale for years - proxies, queues, jobs, the hard parts. You keep the key; we keep it fast.</p>
        <div class="pact"><a class="pill" href="#" data-key>Get a key →</a></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="quip"><b>Who runs it better than the people who built it?</b> Self-host for control; host with us to move fast. Same crawler either way.</div>

    <h2 id="pricing"><span class="h">##</span> Pricing <a class="anch" href="#pricing">#</a></h2>
    <script>/* the credit numbers: read live from GET /v1/prices at load (fleet_config and tier_rules); these are only the fallback when that call fails */
window.CREDIT={signup:0,monthly:1000,guest:20,usd:0.001,search:1,scrape:0.5,
  plans:{starter:{usd:10,usd_year:100,credits:10000,per_minute:120,at_once:10,extra_usd_per_1k:1},builder:{usd:99,usd_year:990,credits:125000,per_minute:600,at_once:20,extra_usd_per_1k:0.79},scale:{usd:499,usd_year:4990,credits:750000,per_minute:1500,at_once:50,extra_usd_per_1k:0.67}},
  limits:{community:{requests_per_minute:10,concurrent:2,allowance_per_month:2500}}};</script>
    <div class="quip">Your favourite open-source crawler, now in the cloud. <b>One monthly plan, credits inside:</b> you pay very little and get more than anywhere else.</div>
    <p class="tryline">Try it now: <b><span data-credit="guest">20</span> free credits</b>, no signup. Verify your email for <b><span data-credit="monthly">1,000</span> free credits every month</b>.</p>
    <div class="bill" role="group" aria-label="Billing"><button type="button" data-bill="year" class="on">Yearly <b>· 2 months free</b></button><button type="button" data-bill="month">Monthly</button></div>
    <div class="ptab">
      <div class="prow"><div>tier</div><div>price</div><div>for</div></div>
      <div class="prow free"><div class="tier">Free</div><div class="amt">$0<small> · no card</small></div><div class="for">Prototypes and side projects. <span data-credit="monthly">1,000</span> credits every month, <span data-credit="limits.community.requests_per_minute">10</span> a minute, <span data-credit="limits.community.concurrent">2</span> at a time. <span class="cta" data-key>Get a key</span></div></div>
      <div class="prow credit"><div class="tier">Starter</div><div class="amt" data-plan-amt="starter">$<span data-credit="plans.starter.usd">10</span><small> a month</small></div><div class="for"><span data-credit="plans.starter.credits">10,000</span> credits a month, <span data-credit="plans.starter.per_minute">120</span> a minute, <span data-credit="plans.starter.at_once">10</span> at a time. Extra credits at $<span data-credit="plans.starter.extra_usd_per_1k">1</span> per 1,000. <a class="cta" href="/dashboard/#billing" data-start-link>Start</a></div></div>
      <div class="prow credit"><div class="tier">Builder</div><div class="amt" data-plan-amt="builder">$<span data-credit="plans.builder.usd">99</span><small> a month</small></div><div class="for"><span data-credit="plans.builder.credits">125,000</span> credits a month, <span data-credit="plans.builder.per_minute">600</span> a minute, <span data-credit="plans.builder.at_once">20</span> at a time. Extra credits at $<span data-credit="plans.builder.extra_usd_per_1k">0.79</span> per 1,000. <a class="cta" href="/dashboard/#billing" data-start-link>Start</a></div></div>
      <div class="prow credit"><div class="tier">Scale</div><div class="amt" data-plan-amt="scale">$<span data-credit="plans.scale.usd">499</span><small> a month</small></div><div class="for"><span data-credit="plans.scale.credits">750,000</span> credits a month, <span data-credit="plans.scale.per_minute">1,500</span> a minute, <span data-credit="plans.scale.at_once">50</span> at a time. Extra credits at $<span data-credit="plans.scale.extra_usd_per_1k">0.67</span> per 1,000. <a class="cta" href="/dashboard/#billing" data-start-link>Start</a></div></div>
      <div class="prow"><div class="tier">Enterprise</div><div class="amt" style="color:#fff">Let's talk</div><div class="for">Volume, regions, SLA. <span class="cta ln" data-entform style="cursor:pointer">Contact us</span></div></div>
